Package: templr
Type: Package
Title: MASCOTNUM / RT-UQ Algorithms Template Tools
Version: 0.2-4
Date: 2026-08-26
Author: Yann Richet [aut, cre] (ORCID: <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5677-8458>)
Maintainer: Yann Richet <yann.richet@asnr.fr>
Authors@R: 
     c(person(given = "Yann",
             family = "Richet",
